>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>Hi, I'm Neel (neovim btw)</p>
  <p>
    I'm a backend engineer with 5+ years building low-latency, fault-tolerant
    systems for a retail trading platform, in Go and Elixir. The work spans
    automated risk controls, real-time market-data delivery, and internal
    platform tooling, each taken from design to production.
  </p>
  <p>
    I also solve product problems, talk to customers, and mentor teams on AI
    adoption. I'm looking for Gen AI and senior backend roles,
    and the <a href="/resume">resume</a> has the detail.
  </p>
  <p>
    I've worked closely with multiple teams and stakeholders to deliver
    impactful solutions. My philosophy is simple: get it done. I focus on
    identifying inefficiencies and fixing them. Over the years, I've learned
    that building fast and delivering quality are equally essential.
  </p>

